  53:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_Start() to start DMA transfer after the configuration of Source
  54:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               address and destination address and the Length of data to be transferred
  55:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_PollForTransfer() to poll for the end of current transfer, in this
  56:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               case a fixed Timeout can be configured by User depending from his application.
  57:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
